{
  "id": "course-records",
  "title": {
    "zh": "课程",
    "en": "Courses"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "整理研究生课程：学期与起止日期、课程号、教师、上课时间、学习笔记、作业与考试（含补交标记）、关联会议 / 行动项 / 稿件与课程材料。列表按学期分组，近期事项把各门课未完成的作业与考试按日期排在一起。课程不算学分，不校验培养规则。",
    "en": "Organises graduate courses: term with dates, course code, teacher, schedule, study notes, assignments and exams (including a late flag), linked meetings / actions / manuscripts and course materials. The list groups by term and a coming-up section lines up open work across courses by date. Credits and programme rules are not computed."
  },
  "author": "dsh-scholar-board",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "sizes": [
    "m",
    "l"
  ],
  "source": "widget-board:records",
  "capabilities": [
    "widget-board:records.read",
    "widget-board:records.write",
    "widget-board:records.draft"
  ],
  "defaultBox": {
    "w": 2,
    "h": 30
  },
  "minBox": {
    "w": 1,
    "h": 16
  },
  "scripts": [
    "course-model.js",
    "copy.js",
    "view.js",
    "rows.js",
    "editor.js"
  ],
  "props": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 80
      },
      "kicker": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 40
      }
    }
  },
  "data": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "records": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 200,
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "quota": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "total": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "truncated": {
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    }
  },
